WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
[upbeat music] A whole AI crew, inside your computer.

2
00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
It sees your GPU and picks the model.

3
00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
You ask for something...

4
00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
They plan, talk and build real files.

5
00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Each step waits for your OK: approve, reject or review.

6
00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Done. The page is ready in the live preview.

7
00:30.000 --> 00:35.000
A better prompt at the end: the report shows how to ask better next time.

8
00:35.000 --> 00:40.000
Pull request on GitHub: commit, push and PR, always after your yes.

9
00:40.000 --> 00:45.000
Themes, in one click. Eight built in, or the crew designs one.

10
00:45.000 --> 00:50.000
10 languages. It follows your browser and switches live.

11
00:50.000 --> 00:55.000
Runs on your PC. No account, your files stay with you, free and open source.

12
00:55.000 --> 01:00.000
Small models: great for small and medium tasks. The crew takes turns on one model, so a job takes minutes.

13
01:00.000 --> 01:10.000
How to start: download for Windows, macOS or Linux, or run npx hivedesk.

14
01:10.000 --> 01:15.000
hivedesk. Open source. Free. github.com/kwy404/hivedesk

